#: src/components/organisms/StripePaymentEmbed.re.mjs:112
msgid ""
"The card form could not be loaded. Check your connection or turn off any "
"content blocker, then try again."
msgstr "無法載入卡片表單。請檢查網路連線或關閉內容封鎖程式，然後再試一次。"

#: src/components/organisms/StripePaymentEmbed.re.mjs:117
